title: A guest closes its app with text not saved: the host is told, keeps the text and can save it and go on
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-log: saved .*notes\.txt
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: ^line 01\nline 02left-by-beto\.\nline 03\nline 04\nline 05host-alone\.\nline 06\n
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared.*share-text

wait 3000
share join nothing Ana
share start writers
wait 13000
share panel
wait 1200
mark host-after-the-guest-quit
wait 800
share panel close
wait 300
key save
wait 1200
edit notes.txt 5 1
key end
type host-alone.
wait 300
key save
wait 1500
mark host-alone
wait 1500
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
edit notes.txt 2 1
key end
type left-by-beto.
wait 2000
quit
wait 1500
